
📈 Netflix Stock Dashboard

📌 Project Overview

This project is an interactive Power BI dashboard created to analyze Netflix stock market performance. It provides a clear view of stock prices, trading volume, and market trends over different time periods.

🎯 Objectives

- Analyze Netflix stock price movements
- Compare Open, High, Low, and Close prices
- Analyze trading volume over time
- Track stock trends using interactive charts
- Filter data by date and year

🛠️ Tools & Technologies

- Power BI
- Power Query
- DAX
- Microsoft Excel / CSV Dataset

📊 Dashboard Features

- KPI cards for stock price analysis
- Open, High, Low, and Close price analysis
- Trading volume visualization
- Stock price trend analysis
- Date range slicer
- Year slicer
- Interactive charts and filters

📈 Key Visualizations

- Average Open Price
- Maximum High Price
- Minimum Low Price
- Average Close Price
- Trading Volume by Date
- Stock Price Trend
- Date and Year Filters

📂 Project Files

- "Netflix Stock Dashboard.pbix" – Power BI dashboard
- "Netflix Stock Dataset.csv" – Dataset used for analysis
- "README.md" – Project documentation

💡 Conclusion

The Netflix Stock Dashboard provides an interactive and easy-to-understand view of Netflix stock performance. It helps users explore stock price trends and trading volume using different dates and time periods.
